---
const GH = 'https://github.com/GustavoPenaBeltrami/self-learning-platform';
---
<section class="closing">
  <div class="kanji" aria-hidden="true">独</div>
  <div class="label">独学 · dokugaku</div>
  <h2>Study alone. Never unguided.</h2>
  <p class="intro">One person, one topic, and the discipline to keep going. The agent teaches, quizzes and grades. The learning stays yours.</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn primary" href="#start">get started</a><a class="btn" href={GH}>view on github</a></div>
</section>

<style>
  .closing { position: relative; overflow: clip; }
  .closing > :not(.kanji) { position: relative; }
  .kanji { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 900 clamp(220px, 38vw, 460px)/1 var(--kanji); color: var(--graphite); pointer-events: none; user-select: none; animation: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @keyframes closing-drift { from { transform: translateY(-18%); } to { transform: translateY(18%); } }
    @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
      .kanji { animation-name: closing-drift; animation-timing-function: linear; animation-fill-mode: both; animation-duration: auto; animation-timeline: view(); animation-range: cover; }
    }
  }
</style>
